# Official Grant Account — controlled update (ops)

## Product rule

Partners **cannot** save Official Grant Account (ABN/BSB/account) from Lookup.

1. Lookup shows **masked read-only** details (or “not registered”).
2. Partner may **Request update** → `POST /api/fundraising/lookup/bank` emails SELPIC admins (no DB bank mutation).
3. SELPIC admin verifies, enters bank/ABN on **Partner Registry**, Saves with **change reason**.
4. Admin PUT `/api/admin/fundraising` persists partner, writes `fundraising_grant_account_events` with `changedBy: 'admin'`, sends **D16** (partner) + **D17** (admin).

`PUT /api/fundraising/lookup/bank` returns **405**.

## Admin validation

Use `validateGrantAccountForm` / ABN checksum when completing Official Grant Account on Partner Registry before Mark Paid.

